  m_Name: Scout Blackwood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Scout Blackwood
  offerText: I am collecting capital for a high-risk expedition overseas. Hand over
    a substantial fee now, and if my ships return, you will be heavily compensated.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the heavy purse. You spend the next hour anxiously
    pacing, wondering if you were completely scammed.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to throw your money into the ocean. Your wallet stays
    heavy, but your life stays entirely average.
  acceptedDelayedText: Blackwood's ships returned overflowing with rare spices! He
    sends a courier with your cut, and you are suddenly very wealthy.
  rejectedDelayedText: 'You read the paper: Blackwood''s expedition was a historic
    success. The crushing realization of the missed wealth completely ruins your
    mood.'
  accepted: 0
  rejectedEffects:
  - type: 0
    amount: -25
    revealDelay: 4
